OL,3,GNEWSAGrandfather's oesophagus rebuilt
OL,4,Ausing stomach
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 73-year-old grandfather has had his
OL,7,Foesophagus rebuilt using part of his
OL,8,Fstomach in a rare operation.
OL,10,FUniversity Hospitals of North Midlands
OL,11,F(UHNM) said Graham Swinbourne, from
OL,12,FLudlow, Shropshire, had developed a
OL,13,Fserious complication that left his
OL,14,Foesophagus completely severed in his
OL,15,Fneck.
OL,17,FFive surgeons were involved in the
OL,18,Fcomplex eight-hour operation at Royal
OL,19,FStoke University Hospital where the
OL,20,Fpatient is still recovering.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,359,350,200,160,0,100
