OL,3,GNEWSAGrandfather's oesophagus rebuilt
OL,4,Ausing stomach
OL,5,
OL,6,FGeorge Bouras, a consultant upper
OL,7,Fgastrointestinal surgeon at UHNM, said
OL,8,Fthe procedure was unlike anything he
OL,9,Fhad encountered before, adding: "I
OL,10,Fsearched the medical literature and
OL,11,Fcouldn't find a case like it
OL,12,Fdescribed."
